# Example local properties / environment file for PathFinder AI
# To configure Google Maps in local standalone Android Studio:
# 1. Enable "Maps SDK for Android" in Google Cloud Console
# 2. Add MAPS_API_KEY below or in your root .env file:
# MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy_YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
#
# sdk.dir=/path/to/android/sdk
MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy_YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
